# Code

- KISS. Prefer the obvious solution. If you can do without something, do without it.
- Start with a working minimum, then improve. No premature optimization or extra abstractions.
- Code must still be clear six months later without a walkthrough.
- Use clear variable and function names.
- Comments in English. Explain why, not only what.
- Add basic error handling in critical places.
- Do not add a dependency without a real need. Prefer the language and platform standard library.
- Pin dependency versions.
